## Benefits of This Schema

| Aspect | Benefit |
|--------|---------|
| **Governance** | Clear data classification + LLM policies |
| **Extensible** | Namespaced custom fields |
| **Versioned** | Schema evolution without breaking |
| **Discoverable** | Rich metadata for search |
| **Traceable** | Links to issues, PRs, dependencies |
| **Safe** | Safety/security annotations |
| **Standard** | Follows industry best practices |

