## Validation Tools

**Before committing, all code is automatically validated:**

### Python Validation (Ruff - Rust-based, 100x faster!)
```bash
just fmt        # Format Python code
just lint       # Lint all code
just typecheck  # Type check with mypy
```

Configuration: `ruff.toml`, `pyproject.toml`

### Documentation Validation
```bash
just test-docs  # Test code examples in docs
python tools/validate_frontmatter.py  # Validate YAML frontmatter
python tools/validate_specs.py        # Check spec completeness
```

### All Validations
```bash
just validate   # Run all validations
just ci         # Full CI pipeline (validate + test)
```

### Pre-Commit Hooks
All validations run automatically on commit:
```bash
pre-commit install  # One-time setup
git commit          # Auto-runs all checks
```

